  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Salesian Sisters PROJECT: The aim is to provide quality vocational skills training to furthest behind communities. Main objective is to enhance the capacity of people with disabilities for community-based rehabilitation and ensure they can realize and access their rights within families, communities, and the government. Activities include support for women&#x2019;s economic empowerment, training in traditional tribal costume weaving, entrepreneurship, leadership, and literacy programs, linking women entrepreneurs to government schemes and support systems.</narrative>
  </description>
